stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> route
  route : route
  contextRetrieved : retrieve the question with the condition's search recipe (step retrieve; logs search.result)
  contextOracle : gold chunks first, then the retrieved items (step oracle; logs search.result)
  answering : answer from the context (step answer; logs llm.called)
  judging : grade the answer against the reference (step judge; logs llm.called)
  scoring : compute recall and persist the result (step score; logs eval.question.scored)
  done : done
  failed : failed
  route --> answering : always [isNone]
  route --> answering : always [isGold]
  route --> contextOracle : always [isOracle]
  route --> contextRetrieved : always
  contextRetrieved --> answering : done
  contextRetrieved --> failed : error
  contextOracle --> answering : done
  contextOracle --> failed : error
  answering --> judging : done
  answering --> failed : error
  judging --> scoring : done
  judging --> failed : error
  scoring --> done : done
  scoring --> failed : error
  done --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
